{"base_rate":0.24006908462867013,"brier":0.08649568221070812,"bss":0.5258845814257684,"bss_hi":0.6090950475883159,"bss_lo":0.42807947129324525,"chart":{"base":[269.5,100.5],"fp":[239.7,262.1],"lead":"62,264.1 272,246.9 482,225 692,191.4","note":{"base":"skill 0.53 — higher than 94% of cities","fp":"low end +1pp, high end +10pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.0 °C — better than 71% of cities","rel":"promised 2% → rained 3%; promised 90% → rained 82%"},"rel":"74,452.3 296.4,354.1 630.3,109.6"},"country":"ES","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve"],"ece":0.04545768566493953,"ess":332.34850907965284,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Barcelona</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Barcelona rain forecast is strongly skilful, though 3 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (98%), believe about\n<b>94%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>2%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 579 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-31. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nBARCELONA-EL RAVAL, 0.9 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.53, ranked 14 of\n216 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(4&ndash;44) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>2%</b></td><td class='num'>285</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>8%</td><td class='num'><b>10%</b></td><td class='num'>62</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>24%</td><td class='num'><b>21%</b></td><td class='num'>52</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>49%</td><td class='num'><b>30%</b></td><td class='num'>60</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>81%</td><td class='num'><b>69%</b></td><td class='num'>55</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>98%</td><td class='num'><b>94%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">3 of 6 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Barcelona</b> <span class=\"muted\">Spain</span></p>\n  <div class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag good\">Strongly skilful</span><details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What does this label mean?\" title=\"What does this label mean?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>Compared with a simple guess: saying &ldquo;24% chance of rain&rdquo; every day, because it rains here on 24% of days.</p><p>The forecast did far better.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details>\n    <span class=\"muted\">3 points off by more than chance</span></div>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score<details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What is the skill score?\" title=\"What is the skill score?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>How much better the forecast is than that simple guess. 0 means no better, 1 means perfect, below 0 means worse. Day-ahead rain forecasts usually score 0.3 to 0.5.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details></dt><dd>0.53</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>4&ndash;44\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 216</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>579 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Barcelona &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Barcelona\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"59.75136842105263,376.89122807017543 87.57612903225805,323.2903225806452 143.16423076923076,256.0 230.04399999999998,163.6 344.09636363636355,51.09090909090912 405.41015384615383,18.0 405.41015384615383,40.39999999999998 344.09636363636355,123.89090909090908 230.04399999999998,248.53333333333333 143.16423076923076,333.0 87.57612903225805,376.1290322580645 59.75136842105263,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"294.6148531951641\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"294.6148531951641\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"59.75136842105263,375.6140350877193 87.57612903225805,346.7741935483871 143.16423076923076,305.0 230.04399999999998,272.8 344.09636363636355,130.5090909090909 405.41015384615383,40.39999999999998\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 2% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 285 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"59.75136842105263\" cy=\"375.6140350877193\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 8%&amp;#10;It rained 10% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 62 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"87.57612903225805\" cy=\"346.7741935483871\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 24%&amp;#10;It rained 21% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 52 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"143.16423076923076\" cy=\"305.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 49%&amp;#10;It rained 30% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 60 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"230.04399999999998\" cy=\"272.8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 81%&amp;#10;It rained 69% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 55 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"344.09636363636355\" cy=\"130.5090909090909\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 98%&amp;#10;It rained 94% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"405.41015384615383\" cy=\"40.39999999999998\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(24%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Not enough days in this city's record to split the year into four and still say anything defensible about each part. The split is shown only where it is supported.</p>\n"},"lat":41.38879,"lon":2.15899,"n":579,"n_cities":216,"name":"Barcelona","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.05,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.004947368421052632,"n":285,"obs":0.017543859649122806,"sig":true},{"hi":0.17400000000000204,"lo":0.05,"mean":0.08354838709677417,"n":62,"obs":0.0967741935483871,"sig":false},{"hi":0.35,"lo":0.17400000000000204,"mean":0.24057692307692308,"n":52,"obs":0.21153846153846154,"sig":false},{"hi":0.7,"lo":0.35,"m